# spec-drift-check.sh allowlist.
#
# Path patterns (extended regex) whose changes do NOT require a
# corresponding update to spec.md.  Keep this file short: every
# exception erodes the spec/code invariant the check exists to enforce.
#
# Format: one path pattern per line.  Blank lines and lines starting
# with `#` are ignored.  Patterns are matched against paths returned
# by `git diff --name-only`.

# Internal refactors of matcher.rs that only touch the test module are
# allowed without a spec update.  (The check operates at file granularity;
# this allowance is documented here so reviewers know to look closer.)
# — none currently —
